menu "HardFOC Vortex HAL"

    config HARDFOC_HAL_CANOPENNODE_SLAVE
        bool "Build the CANopenNode stack (generic hf-core driver)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles CANopenNode v4 into the hf-hal-vortex-v1 component through
            hf-core's CMake, with the generic driver CO_driver_hardfoc.c and the
            EspTwaiPort binding (hf-core handlers/common/canopen/).
            Vendor tree: third_party/CANopenNode (git submodule).

            The object dictionary comes from the application: its project
            CMakeLists.txt sets HF_CORE_CANOPENNODE_OD_DIR (OD.c / OD.h) and
            optionally HF_CORE_CANOPENNODE_CONFIG_DIR (hf_co_app_config.h)
            before project(). The upstream example OD is not compiled.

            After enabling, initialize the submodule from the HAL repo root:

                git submodule update --init --recursive third_party/CANopenNode

endmenu
